<HelloFraandsPage title="Influencer rules" summary="Call lena aapki marzi hai; hadon ka dhyaan rakhein." review={true} related={[{href:'/hosts/agreement',label:'Influencer agreement'},{href:'/hosts/crisis-script',label:'Crisis script'}]}>
<h2>Choose whether to take each call</h2>
<p>Your phone will ring first. A private announcement will say that a fan wants to talk, give the caller's handle, how many times they have called you before, and your saved caller note if you have one. Press <strong>1 to accept</strong> or <strong>2 to decline</strong>. No input within 10 seconds is a decline. The caller is dialled only after you accept; declined or unconnected calls are not billed to the caller.</p>
<p>Set yourself online only when you want calls. You may decline or end a conversation without explaining why. Do not stay on an uncomfortable call to earn more minutes.</p>
<h2>Keep every call respectful</h2>
<ul><li>No sexual or suggestive talk, abuse, threats or harassment.</li><li>Do not ask for or share phone numbers, social accounts, addresses or meetings.</li><li>Do not sell products, services or paid remedies, or solicit money.</li><li>No medical, legal or financial advice, diagnosis or treatment.</li><li>Astrology is for reflection and entertainment. Never promise an outcome.</li></ul>
<p>If you list women's health as a topic, respectful discussion of periods, PCOS, pregnancy and other health experiences is welcome. Do not mistake ordinary health vocabulary for sexual misconduct. The same consent and anti-harassment boundaries apply.</p>
<h2>Know the two keypad controls</h2>
<ul><li><strong>* — end:</strong> ends the connected call. Use this when you simply need to leave.</li><li><strong># — end, block and flag:</strong> ends the call, blocks this caller from calling you again and creates an incident for review. A pending incident is not a confirmed strike.</li></ul>
<p>These keys are for the influencer's phone during the connected call. Either participant can also hang up normally. After a call, the influencer WhatsApp message shows duration and earnings: reply <strong>1 to block</strong>, <strong>2 to report</strong>, or <strong>3 to tag</strong>. The dashboard offers the same actions. Do not put sensitive personal details in caller notes.</p>
<h2>Distress is not misconduct</h2>
<p>If someone mentions self-harm, use the <a href="/hosts/crisis-script">crisis script</a> to direct them to appropriate support. Do not use the # end-and-block key solely because they are distressed. Such mentions are for welfare review only and must never earn a strike. Do not promise emergency dispatch or a response from the platform.</p>
<h2>Safety</h2>
<p>No human monitors or listens to your calls. Spammy, sexual or threatening behaviour is not allowed; report it and use # to end the call and block the person. We train influencers regularly to spot scam and spam callers. Read the <a href="/safety">safety centre</a>.</p>
<h2>Account action</h2>
<p>Enforcement and earnings terms are in the <a href="/hosts/agreement">influencer agreement</a>. See <a href="/grievance">Grievance redressal</a> to raise a concern.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
